Howdy Div13. I made Muertak last night on Gawaine/Midgard.<P>Muertak<BR>dorf<BR>level 3<BR>Runemaster<BR>Main spec is Runecarving.<BR>Short term goal:<BR>All Runecarving till level 13<BR>then Suppresion to 2 or 5. (unconfirmed reports of additional damage absorber at level5)<P>Looks like we got a good group here.<BR>We are lacking on tanks and havinga skald. However, I believe lots of people are playing those 2 classes in this realm and it willbe easy to find em.<P>Going to play him tonight. Should make level 6.
