So far we have:<BR>Wardak  - Norse Warrior (7th)<BR>Medec   - Dorf Healer (5th+)<BR>Bluhr   - Smurf Shadowblade (5th+)<BR>Ghall   - Troll Shaman (6th)<BR>Meurtak - Dorf Runemaster (3rd)<BR>?????   - ???? ?????????? ???? - Gastro<P>So we have one tank, one primary melee and a few casters that can melee if needed.<P>We could use:<BR>Skald<BR>TANK of some sort<BR>Healer that goes with Augment as prime<P>--------------------<P> <img src="http://people.mn.mediaone.net/raven13/images/Ghall.gif"> 
